.Dd $Mdocdate: September 17 2026 $
.Dt CLI-GENERATED.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm cli-generated.conf
.Nd cli-generated configuration file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Xr cli-generated 1
reads its configuration from
.Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cli-generated/config.toml ,
or the file given with
.Fl f .
A missing default file is treated as empty; a missing file given with
.Fl f
is an error.
The file is TOML.
Unknown keys are rejected.
All keys are optional.
.Sh SETTINGS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm name No = Ar string
Name used in the greeting.
Must not be empty.
Default:
.Ql world .
.It Cm retries No = Ar integer
Example numeric setting.
Must be at most 10.
Default: 3.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width ~/.config/cli-generated/config.toml -compact
.It Pa ~/.config/cli-generated/config.toml
Default location.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
name = "there"
retries = 5
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cli-generated 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An your name Aq Mt author@example.com
